Summary for Your Notes-
----------------------

| Member          | Purpose                         | Notes                             |
| --------------- | ------------------------------- | --------------------------------- |
| `.Length`       | Count total characters          | Includes spaces                   |
| `.ToUpper()`    | Converts to uppercase           | Useful for standardization        |
| `.ToLower()`    | Converts to lowercase           | Useful for comparisons            |
| `.Trim()`       | Removes spaces (start + end)    | Important when getting user input |
| `.Contains()`   | Checks if word exists           | Returns true/false                |
| `.StartsWith()` | Checks if string starts with... | Returns true/false                |
| `.EndsWith()`   | Checks if string ends with...   | Returns true/false                |

